Canonical product file: `Mus_Build_Source_of_Truth.md`. Hierarchy: that file, then an explicit owner override, then Claude design that does not contradict it, then ADRs, then code.

KayaMo is the shipped product name for now. Companion is **Mus** (mustard seed). Bundle ID `ph.kayamo.app`. First market: Philippines.

Five tabs only: **Home** (Daily Command Center), **Goals**, **Life** (areas; Physical Self holds food/gym), **Grove** (XP/tree/story), **Mus** (full chat). No sixth primary add tab.

Phase 0–3 are in. Phase 4 is **integrations and agentic action** without faking calendar, health, wearables, weather, or web research. Ship a permission center, documented platform limits, and local alternatives (manual busy blocks, Plan Tomorrow as a confirmable proposal, browser voice only when SpeechRecognition exists). Auto-manage stays off. Do not start other life-area modules. Do not silently drop §37 inventory — mark `SHIPPED` / `PLANNED` / `DEFERRED_*`.

Mus proposes; the user confirms writes. Stored data is not automatically AI-readable. XP never decreases. Use **Released**, not failed, when a goal is set down. No shame copy, no tree death, no diagnoses, no “God told me”.
